    "terrainName": "basic-desert",
    "description": "What: AQ103 (CE-2368, R-2074) - idle life on open basic-desert, nobody hostile: 'Idler 1-4' (Friend riflemen, NO orders - the SOP's own idle choice), a 'Watchman' (ordered to stay and watch east), 'Held' (ordered to hold: Idle from a superior), 'Down' (incapacitated, 20 %), a 'Waiting civilian' (ordered to stand) and a 'Townsman' (his own routine). Judge (90 s): (1) each Idler shifts at least twice and never strays past 3 m from where he settled; (2) the Watchman, Held and Down never shift (< 0.3 m); (3) idle gestures (smoking, shifting weight, a stretch, looking about - the flag the IG animates) show on at least half of the Idlers, the Watchman, Held and the waiting civilian; (4) Down shows none. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch il-idle-life. \ud83d\udcc4 docs/blueprints/Architect_Question_103_Idle_Life.md"
  },
